  "_name": "GFO2p0 (FMArena community formula)",
  "_source": "FMArena.com forum — derived for Striker, stated valid for all outfield except DC/GK",
  "_notes": [
    "GK, DC and FB groups use the FMSuperScout Default weights unchanged.",
    "DM, MC, WM, AM and ST all share one unified outfield formula (GFO2p0 treats them identically).",
    "LeftFoot and RightFoot map to footLeft/footRight (raw 1-20 values exported by the plugin since the foot-export patch). Weight: LeftFoot=6.0, RightFoot=5.0 across all outfield groups.",
    "Professionalism, Ambition, Loyalty and Pressure are read from top-level player fields (not p.attrs) via player_fields.",
    "Adverse terms use interaction_penalties (not adverse_attributes): IP penalty scales INVERSELY with NaturalFitness (low-fitness players take a bigger injury risk hit); Dirtiness penalty scales DIRECTLY with Aggression (aggressive dirty players are penalised harder). InjuryProneness and Dirtiness do NOT appear in position_weights.",
    "Weights are used as relative importance in a normalised weighted-average (1–20 scale). The interaction penalties are subtracted from the raw numerator before dividing by the weight sum, preserving the 1-20 output range."
  ],

